  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "defer_t",
   "x": 84,
   "y": 848,
   "width": 1057,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "The deferred cache is the load-bearing rule\nA finished result is written only once the step AND all of its recursive NextSteps have succeeded, so a finished\nentry is genuinely done. The one exception is a suspended step: stored with SuspendInfo so the next pass restores it.",
   "originalText": "The deferred cache is the load-bearing rule\nA finished result is written only once the step AND all of its recursive NextSteps have succeeded, so a finished\nentry is genuinely done. The one exception is a suspended step: stored with SuspendInfo so the next pass restores it.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#065f46",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
